# Fantasy Football Data Refresh — runs every 2 hours (DATA-01 requirement)
# The refresh script handles off-season detection internally (DATA-03).
# Cron always fires; the script returns early during off-season.
#
# Installation:
#   1. Replace /path/to/fantasy-football with your actual project path
#   2. Run: crontab -e
#   3. Paste the line below (without the leading #)
#
# Logs: logs/refresh.log (7-day rotation) + cron stdout capture
#
0 */2 * * * /path/to/fantasy-football/.venv/bin/python /path/to/fantasy-football/scripts/refresh.py >> /path/to/fantasy-football/logs/cron.log 2>&1
